			"notes": "# CraftyAI v1.3.2-forge — Forge & NeoForge Release\n\nCraftyAI brings an intelligent, context-aware AI assistant directly into your Minecraft Forge and NeoForge server.\n\n---\n\n## What's Changed\n\n*No changelog entry found for this version.*\n\n---\n\n## Download & Installation\n\n| File | Platform |\n|------|----------|\n| `craftyai-forge-*.jar` | Forge (Minecraft 1.20.4) — drop into `mods/` |\n| `craftyai-forge-1206-*.jar` | Forge (Minecraft 1.20.6) — drop into `mods/` |\n| `craftyai-forge-26-*.jar` | NeoForge (Minecraft 26.x) — drop into `mods/` |\n\n---\n\n## Getting Started\n\n1. Drop the appropriate Forge / NeoForge jar into `mods/`.\n2. Restart your server.\n3. Press **M** in-game or use `/crafty settings` to open settings and click \"Auto-Mint Free Key\".\n4. Chat with the AI by typing `@crafty <question>` in chat.\n\nNeed help? Visit https://craftyai.pages.dev or join our Discord: https://discord.gg/zCkE44hsBR"
		},
