			"notes": "# CraftyAI v1.3.2-spigot — Spigot/Paper Plugin Release\n\nCraftyAI brings an intelligent, context-aware AI assistant directly into your Minecraft server.\n\n---\n\n## What's Changed\n\n*No changelog entry found for this version.*\n\n---\n\n## Download & Installation\n\n| File | Platform |\n|------|----------|\n| `craftyai-spigot-*.jar` | Spigot, Paper, Purpur, Folia (Minecraft 1.8+) — drop into your `plugins/` folder |\n\n---\n\n## Getting Started\n\n1. Drop the plugin jar into `plugins/`.\n2. Restart your server.\n3. As an OP, type `/crafty apikey` in-game; the plugin will mint and save your connection key for you.\n4. Chat with the AI by prefixing your message with `@crafty ` (or just `@`).\n5. Try an agentic action: `@crafty change time to day` or `@crafty scan the area`.\n\nNeed help? Visit https://craftyai.pages.dev or join our Discord: https://discord.gg/zCkE44hsBR"
		}
